  "all_ingredients_flat": "rolled oats, corn, black beans, onion, garlic, carrots, beets, low sodium soy sauce, garlic powder, cumin powder, coriander powder, red chili powder, salt, pepper, cayenne pepper, quick oats",
  "instructions": "Veggie Masala: Heat a pan. Combine onion, garlic, salt & pepper. Cook until onion is translucent. Add carrots, beets, cumin powder, coriander powder, chili powder & cayenne pepper until carrots are tender. Remove pan from stovetop.\nIn a bowl, mash cooked black beans. Add Veggie Masala, along with soy sauce, quick oats & corn. Mix well & form patties.\nPlace patties in freezer for 30 minutes to set. Then cook them on a pan over medium heat, flipping halfway to cook both sides.\nUse patties to create your dream veggie burger!",
  "cooking_methods": [
    "saute",
    "no-cook",
    "freeze",
    "pan-fry"
  ],
  "serving_suggestion": "Use patties to create your dream veggie burger!",
  "notes": "A recipe with WHOLE GRAINS (corn, quick oats), BEANS (black beans), RAINBOW VEGGIES (carrots, beets, onion, garlic), HERBS & SPICES (various).",
